sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Dashboard
  participant PHP as Laravel Service
  participant R as Rust handler
  participant C as External client
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  UI->>PHP: GET /api/iss/last
  PHP->>R: GET /last
  R->>DB: repository latest_iss()
  DB-->>R: TIMESTAMPTZ + JSONB
  R-->>PHP: HTTP 200 JSON
  PHP-->>UI: ViewModel / JSON
  R->>C: retry + timeout + User-Agent (background fetch)
